    "renderer": "1280x720, 60 Hz scheduled render loop, 1450 shader iterations. Four game recording segments and six trailer segments. No running game client. The separate IOKit diagnostic uses identical renderer settings; inference latency runs have no telemetry hook.",
    "fixed": "One separate warmup per version; identical six chronological frames, JPEG bytes, prompt, model, sampling settings and 160-token cap. Alternating order in pairs and round-robin over all six orders for triples. Wall time covers prepared JPEG to final returned text, including all attempts. Quantiles use median and nearest-rank P95. Timings vary with contention. All-attempts includes malformed replies; matched cited subset requires a parseable observation and references on both sides. Raw answers and timestamps in the local archive.",
